; DLL search-order hardening: wtsapi32.dll is not a KnownDLL, so it must not be
; a static import (see Makefile's DELAY_LIBS comment). It is only needed while a
; voice recording runs, to hear the session lock; the delay-load hook records
; the request. Lists only what voice_lock_win.c calls.
LIBRARY wtsapi32.dll
EXPORTS
WTSRegisterSessionNotification
WTSUnRegisterSessionNotification
